#!/bin/sh
# Toggle between my keyboard (izvyk layouts, Caps as Escape, remapping services)
# and stock German. Bound to Super+Delete in GNOME. Each service needs a
# NOPASSWD sudoers rule for "systemctl start|stop <name>.service".

schema=org.gnome.desktop.input-sources
services="keyd logid"

case $(gsettings get $schema sources) in
  *izvyk*)
    gsettings set $schema sources "[('xkb', 'de')]"
    gsettings reset $schema xkb-options
    action=stop title="Keyboard: default" body="German; $services off" ;;
  *)
    gsettings set $schema sources "[('xkb', 'us+izvyk'), ('xkb', 'ru+izvyk')]"
    gsettings set $schema xkb-options "['caps:escape', 'fkeys:basic_13-24']"
    action=start title="Keyboard: custom" body="US/RU izvyk, Caps is Escape, F13-F24 plain; $services on" ;;
esac

for s in $services; do
  sudo systemctl $action "$s.service"
done

notify-send -e -i input-keyboard-symbolic "$title" "$body"
